{"kind": "mod", "id": 1462, "name": "Immersive Daylight Cycle", "slug": "immersive-daylight-cycle", "teaser": "Immersive, Semi-Hardcore Time System!\r\n-Time is paused when out of raid\r\n-Only one time available when entering a raid based on what time it was when you left your last raid\r\n-Configurable daylight cycle rate and more!", "owner_name": "Jehree", "downloads": 6682, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:05:12.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-05T04:14:55.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-05T04:14:55.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "2.2.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This mod does the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pauses in-game time when out of raid</li>\n<li>Slows down the daylight cycle in raid from 7x IRL speed to 5x. (configurable)</li>\n<li>Stores a current out of raid time based on when you left your last raid (can be changed manually in the config)</li>\n<li>When you exit a raid, the current in-game time + a time jump of 1 hour (configurable) will be saved and used when you enter the next raid</li>\n<li>When you die, the time will reset to 8 am (configurable)</li>\n<li>Factory will be locked to day or night depending on the current saved time\n<ul>\n<li>Night time for Factory starts at 21:00 and ends at 06:00</li>\n<li>You can disable the time system specifically for Factory in the config if you’d rather still be able to choose the time on that map</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>NOTE: This mod will NOT affect hideout craft times or trader restocks. You will need to adjust the server-side time rate via SVM or similar to change that.</p>\n<p><strong>If you’d like to support my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/jehree\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee!</a></strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Click the big blue <strong>DOWNLOAD</strong> button in the top right</li>\n<li>Select the correct version</li>\n<li>Drag contents of the zip into the folder you installed SPT to:</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>MASSIVE</strong> thanks to the many awesome people who helped me both with this mod, as well as with learning how to make client mods in general!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/30839-drakiaxyz/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DrakiaXYZ</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/37201-dirtbikercj/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Cj</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/51211-lacyway/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Lacyway</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/16882-arys/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Arys</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/12898-cwx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CWX</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/50720-mpstark/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">mpstark</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/49246-tyfon/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tyfon</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/40264-djlang/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DJ</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>…and probably more. Yell at me if I missed you!</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1593, "published_at": "2024-06-05T04:14:55.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1462/immersive-daylight-cycle/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1554, "published_at": "2024-07-30T01:05:54.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1462/immersive-daylight-cycle/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 527, "published_at": "2025-01-02T01:38:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1462/immersive-daylight-cycle/2.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.1.0+hf1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1064, "published_at": "2025-01-13T15:43:38.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1462/immersive-daylight-cycle/2.1.0+hf1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1944, "published_at": "2025-03-25T15:29:57.000000Z", "forge_link": 